The increase in Ulta Beauty's merchandise inventories balance at the end of fiscal 2023 was primarily due to:

- $54 million increase due to the addition of 47 new stores opened since January 29, 2022 [ULTABEAUTY_2023_10K, p.38];
- $25 million increase due to new key brand launches;
